==Battleground==
*5 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Youcan]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
**5 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Trivia==
*The name of this level is based off of [[wikipedia:Gerardus Mercator|Gerardus Mercator]].
**"Mercator" is also the Latin word for "merchant".

